ोगों के सटीक और त्वरित निदान में मदद करेगी और हेल्थकेयर के क्षेत्र में क्या बदलाव लाएगी।</p><a href="https://mymedisage.com/health/alzheimers-ki-jaanch-ke-liye-pehla-single-biomarker-blood-test-fda-approval" class="mt-3 text-blue-600 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">Read more →</a></div></div></li><li data-index="14" aria-hidden="true" class="react-multi-carousel-item  px-3 py-2" style="flex: 1 1 auto; position: relative; width: 280px;"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-lg transition overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col"><img src="./dhairya_files/1791179086researcher-working-laboratory_1.jpg" srcset="https://d3typ5yqytip29.cloudfront.net/healthhub/posts/1791179086researcher-working-laboratory_1.jpg?format=webp&amp;quality=80&amp;width=512 1x, https://d3typ5yqytip29.cloudfront.net/healthhub/posts/1791179086researcher-working-laboratory_1.jpg?format=webp&amp;quality=80&amp;width=960 2x, https://d3typ5yqytip29.cloudfront.net/healthhub/posts/1791179086researcher-working-laboratory_1.jpg?format=webp&amp;quality=80&amp;width=1440 3x" alt="FDA Clears First Single-Biomarker Blood Test for Alzheimer's" class="w-full h-40 object-cover"><div class="p-4 flex flex-col flex-grow"><span class="text-xs font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded w-fit mb-2"></span><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2 line-clamp-2">FDA Clears First Single-Biomarker Blood Test for Alzheimer's</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-3 flex-grow">Discover the details behind the FDA clearance of the first single biomarker blood test, marking a major advancement in clinical diagnostics and early disease detection.</p><a href="https://mymedisage.com/health/fda-clears-first-single-biomarker-blood-test-for-alzheimers" class="mt-3 text-blue-600 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">Read more →</a></div></div></li><li data-index="15" aria-hidden="true" class="react-multi-carousel-item  px-3 py-2" style="flex: 1 1 auto; position: relative; width: 280px;"><div 